{"4249080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Misguided Remastered", "steam_appid": 4249080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/9e8e3474d5435d22c48e4bb361e47e75.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/9e8e3474d5435d22c48e4bb361e47e75.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/9e8e3474d5435d22c48e4bb361e47e75.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misguided Remastered</strong> is a thirdperson action-horror game that follows Silvia, a high school girl who becomes trapped in a mysterious otherworld. In her desperate search for her missing best friend and the cherished letter from her mother the only thing she remembers from her past, she must confront terrifying supernatural entities inspired by Asian mythology and Indonesian culture. As you explore abandoned houses, destroyed city, eerie landscapes, and shifting realities, you’ll uncover dark secrets behind the experiment that changed everything. Every choice you make influences Silvia’s path and shapes the fate that awaits her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/c6c206cfc93782ffcc99036d1dae7589.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/c6c206cfc93782ffcc99036d1dae7589.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/c6c206cfc93782ffcc99036d1dae7589.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emphasizing Classic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the genre-defining <i>survival horror</i> classics, including <strong>Resident Evil, Silent Hill, Alone in the Dark,</strong> and the chilling Asian influence of <strong>Fatal Frame.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Melee Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the horrifying entities with <strong>limited means</strong>. Silvia is equipped only with what she can find, relying primarily on <strong>close-quarters melee weapons</strong> such as a trusty <strong>knife</strong> and an <strong>axe</strong>. The <strong>handphone</strong> serves as your essential tool for navigating the dark and solving certain environmental puzzles. The <strong>combat</strong> is <strong>brutal and scarce</strong>, demanding precise timing and positioning as you utilize these basic survival tools against the supernatural terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/1a3bed34e7c5dde04de5f848c0b478ff.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/1a3bed34e7c5dde04de5f848c0b478ff.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/1a3bed34e7c5dde04de5f848c0b478ff.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Indonesian Horror:</strong> Experience unique horror with settings and creatures heavily influenced by <strong>Asian folklore and Indonesian culture</strong>, offering a distinctive feel compared to typical Western horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror Blend:</strong> Engage in a challenging mix of gameplay: <strong>limited resource combat</strong> against supernatural entities and <strong>intricate environmental puzzle-solving</strong>, aligning with the spirit of classic survival horror titles like <i>Resident Evil</i> and <i>Silent Hill</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions That Matter:</strong> A non-linear storyline where <strong>your choices</strong> significantly shape the narrative and lead you to one of <i>multiple endings</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Visuals and Atmosphere:</strong> Enjoy enhanced 3D environments featuring <i>cinematic lighting and immersive visual design</i>, creating a truly haunting and tense atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remastered Enhancements for PC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>remastered</strong> version is built upon the original release and significantly improves visuals, gameplay, and narrative elements :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphical Overhaul:</strong> Completely revamped visuals and lighting systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Optimization:</strong> <strong>Smoother and more responsive</strong> controls and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Content:</strong> Redesigned maps and puzzles, <strong>smarter enemy AI</strong>, and subtle story adjustments for greater emotional depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Presentation:</strong> Smoother cutscenes, an improved User Interface (UI), and rebalanced difficulty for a fair challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/aa4e58901ccb486e953f2b9b1ef5bd31.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/aa4e58901ccb486e953f2b9b1ef5bd31.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/aa4e58901ccb486e953f2b9b1ef5bd31.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 Language Availability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in: <strong>English, Indonesian, Japanese, Chinese, Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, Arabic</strong>, <strong>German</strong> and <strong>Korean</strong> (Text/Subtitles).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/2daf79e4e6db4699605e04490d86893a.avif?t=1787673329\" width=1560 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/9e8e3474d5435d22c48e4bb3