nmental puzzle-solving</strong>, aligning with the spirit of classic survival horror titles like <i>Resident Evil</i> and <i>Silent Hill</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions That Matter:</strong> A non-linear storyline where <strong>your choices</strong> significantly shape the narrative and lead you to one of <i>multiple endings</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Visuals and Atmosphere:</strong> Enjoy enhanced 3D environments featuring <i>cinematic lighting and immersive visual design</i>, creating a truly haunting and tense atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.poster.avif?t=1787673329\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.webm?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249080/extras/3a0d6a45a6dad55e53c826b001897beb.mp4?t=1787673329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remastered Enhancements for PC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>remastered</strong> version is built upon the original release and significantly improves visuals, gameplay, and narrative elements :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphical Overhaul:</strong> Completely revamped visuals and lighting systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Optimization:</strong> <strong>Smoother and more responsive</strong> controls and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Content:</strong> Redesigned maps and puzzles, <strong>smarter enemy AI</strong>, and subtle story adjustments for greater emotional depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa